{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=curated_00015","headline":"杂歌谣辞·黄台瓜辞 · 李贤","name":"杂歌谣辞·黄台瓜辞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"种瓜黄台下，瓜熟子离离。一摘使瓜好，再摘令瓜稀。 三摘尚自可，摘绝抱蔓归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/curated_00015.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=curated_00015","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于与开放语料未能唯一对齐，保留为整理本异文/组诗条目","citation":"滕伟明"}